  LayoutDashboard, Network, Rocket, Cloud, Cpu, MessageSquare,
  Sparkles, Layers, History, FlaskConical, Brain, Shield, Code2,
  Zap, FileText, Gauge, Activity, Box, FolderOpen, Settings, Workflow,
